  "description": "<p>This vibrant doormat celebrates love and inclusivity with a colorful rainbow design, adding a welcoming touch to any home. Its cheerful aesthetic helps create a warm and inviting atmosphere for guests, friends, and family. Designed for everyday use, this decorative floor mat brings personality and positivity to your decor.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a bright and colorful Pride design with rainbow artwork.</li>\n<li>Soft and durable material ensures a comfortable surface and long-lasting print.</li>\n<li>Adds a personalized touch to your space.</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor use.</li>\n<li>Creates an inclusive home aesthetic for modern, boho, retro, or eclectic spaces.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Porch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>rainbow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Rainbow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Text Customization</td>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is perfect for entryways, patios, porches, apartments, dorms, classrooms, offices, and other indoor or outdoor spaces. It can be used to add a festive touch during Pride Month or as a thoughtful housewarming gift.</p>",
